of people he cared for realizing the huge ethical&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:42:38.220 --> 01:42:42.900
mistake the foundation had made essentially&nbsp;
psychologically torturing Frazier for information&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:42:42.900 --> 01:42:50.280
he simply didn't have researcher Ryland begged&nbsp;
her superiors that scp-3017 be released the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:42:50.280 --> 01:42:58.500
request was denied and instead Rylan was contained&nbsp;
believed to be a new instance of scp-3017-1 with&nbsp;&nbsp;

