01:44:31.260 --> 01:44:36.000
mistake all records of his supposed criminal&nbsp;
activity and links to anomalous groups were&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:44:36.000 --> 01:44:42.360
stricken from the record as unsubstantiated he&nbsp;
had been innocent all along just a man who had&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:44:42.360 --> 01:44:48.420
never done anything he was accused of and didn't&nbsp;
deserve to be locked away the SCP Foundation had&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:44:48.420 --> 01:44:54.780
tortured Frasier asking him questions he didn't&nbsp;
have the answers to using the love he and for&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:44:54.780 --> 01:44:59.820
those closest to him as a way to try and goat&nbsp;
him into giving the foundation what they wanted&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:44:59.820 --> 01:45:05.820
and in the end may have been responsible for&nbsp;
multiple innocent people being murdered perhaps&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:05.820 --> 01:45:11.640
it was easier for them to stamp neutralize on his&nbsp;
file than to actually face up what they'd done to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:11.640 --> 01:45:17.340
him the foundation has spent at least a century&nbsp;
containing anomalies and monsters but the hardest&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:17.340 --> 01:45:24.060
monsters to contain are often the ones that emerge&nbsp;
within us and nothing better illustrates that than&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:24.060 --> 01:45:33.120
the foundation's Monstrous treatment of scp-317&nbsp;
on the 13th of October 1989 the town of Danner&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:33.120 --> 01:45:38.700
Wisconsin was shaken by a seismic event unlike&nbsp;
anything they'd ever experienced this might have&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:38.700 --> 01:45:44.460
been written off as an earthquake Where not for&nbsp;
one disturbing Factor the ground shaking event was&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:44.460 --> 01:45:50.100
accompanied by a huge Spike of radioactivity with&nbsp;
the strange phenomenon happening a month before&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:50.100 --> 01:45:55.980
the Berlin Wall was torn down during a period of&nbsp;
the Cold War that has historians call the year of&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:55.980 --> 01:46:02.040
Crisis it's easy to understand why the people of&nbsp;
Danner immediately assumed the worst but the huge&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:02.040 --> 01:46:07.920
eruption they felt wasn't the result of a nuclear&nbsp;
bomb going off the SCP Foundation was alerted to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:07.920 --> 01:46:12.600
the event in Danner when they picked up a series&nbsp;
