01:46:24.840 --> 01:46:30.960
meters tall and weighing almost 300 kilograms&nbsp;
the being was green and brown in color with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:30.960 --> 01:46:37.140
bulky humanoid body its head was a different story&nbsp;
though and resembled a gigantic housefly with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:37.140 --> 01:46:43.860
proboscis and huge stereoscopic eyes surprisingly&nbsp;
the strange creature did not immediately go on a&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:43.860 --> 01:46:52.380
rampage instead the being designated scp-2273&nbsp;
appeared to be exhausted injured and extremely&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:52.380 --> 01:46:57.720
malnourished it offered no no resistance at all&nbsp;
to the foundation containment team and it was&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:57.720 --> 01:47:03.960
taken to site 17 without conflict while the SCP&nbsp;
Foundation is no stranger to visitors from other&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:03.960 --> 01:47:09.660
worlds there was something especially unusual&nbsp;
about the supposed alien Invader the doctors&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:09.660 --> 01:47:14.580
who examined the creature and treated its injuries&nbsp;
found an appendage that seemed to function as an&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:14.580 --> 01:47:20.280
organic radio transmitter and large open wounds&nbsp;
on its shoulder blades and forearms where further&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:20.280 --> 01:47:26.340
appendages had been ripped off additionally while&nbsp;
