01:47:32.100 --> 01:47:38.520
markings that on closer inspection looked like&nbsp;
military badges was this some kind of wounded&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:38.520 --> 01:47:43.680
Intergalactic soldier who had been stranded&nbsp;
on Earth if it was then how were the organic&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:43.680 --> 01:47:49.500
badges on this aliens exoskeleton a near perfect&nbsp;
match to military badges worn by soldiers in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:49.500 --> 01:47:54.780
Soviet Union even if they did reference a unit&nbsp;
that didn't officially exist within the Soviet&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:54.780 --> 01:48:02.100
Army the scientists were sure this alien wasn't&nbsp;
an alien at all underneath its exoskeleton was&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:02.100 --> 01:48:08.460
a non-anomalous human being if that was true&nbsp;
then this was even more terrifying than an&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:08.460 --> 01:48:14.220
extraterrestrial visitor the scientists were sure&nbsp;
that the USSR had developed a new kind of organic&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:14.220 --> 01:48:20.220
armor and this anomaly showing up in Wisconsin&nbsp;
was the result of a test on U.S soil that had&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:20.220 --> 01:48:26.100
gone wrong if that was the case then there was&nbsp;
no telling how many more of these exoskeletons&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:26.100 --> 01:48:31.500
