the foundation had to act quickly and find out&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:31.500 --> 01:48:38.220
more while scp-2273 was recovering they called&nbsp;
in Dr Friedrich an on-site psychologist who&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:38.220 --> 01:48:43.200
